# Slovak: Merits casing

When writing or translating UI, email, Rules, or field strings into Slovak:

- Use lowercase **merity** / **merit** / declined forms (**meritov**, **meritom**, …), not title case.
- Capitalize only at the start of a sentence (or in all-caps UI chrome), not as a proper noun mid-sentence.
- English keeps **Merits**; Czech may keep **Merity** unless aligned separately.

```text
❌ ochotným darcom automaticky udelí Merity
✅ ochotným darcom automaticky udelí merity

❌ získať Merity — nefinančné uznanie
✅ získať merity — nefinančné uznanie
```
